[3873]="7004BE53\n1\tDerrota bestias en Agarnaith (total: 8)\030Derrota orcos y uruks en Agarnaith (total: 8)\tGlórellas te pidió que derrotaras bestias y orcos en Agarnaith.\n2\tHabla con Glórellas en la Corte de Celeborn\tGlórellas está en la Corte de Celeborn.\n",
[3874]="7004BE43\n1\tCollect discarded shields from Udûn (total: 6)\030Collect discarded blades from Udûn (total: 6)\tVórthi asked you to search the Orc camps on the valley floor in Udûn for discarded blades and shields that can be turned into dwarf-weapons.\n2\tLoad the weapons and shields into Vágrek's cart near the Udûn Foothold\tVágrek is by his cart near the Udûn Foothold.\n3\tHabla con Vórthi en el Salón Bajo la Montaña\tVórthi is in the Hall Under the Mountain, waiting to hear your report.\n",
[3875]="70028AD4\n1\tRecoge madera robada (total: 10)\030Derrota a ladrones dunlendinos (total: 10)\tEl campamento maderero de Galtrev está al norte, a poca distancia de Galtrev. Se necesita madera del campamento maderero de Galtrev, pero la amenaza de los ladrones del Clan del Dragón complica la entrega.\n2\tLleva la madera que reuniste a Fraid\tFraid está junto al carro volcado, en las afueras del campamento maderero de Galtrev. Debes llevarle a Fraid la madera que reuniste.\n3\tEntrega el envío de madera a Macsen en Galtrev\tLa madera que recogiste está en una pila cerca del carro volcado. Ya recuperaste algo de madera y ahora debes llevarla a Galtrev.\n4\tHabla con Macsen en Galtrev\tMacsen está en Galtrev. Debes hablar con Macsen para completar la entrega diaria de madera del campamento maderero de Galtrev.\n",
[3876]="70072F77\n1\tDestroy spider eggs within the Cloakwood (total: 8)\tEnemies abound in Adagím. Spiders in the Cloakwood are deadly foes from ancient times. They prey upon scouts, breed unchecked, and spread the blight across Nisigím. Destroy spider eggs in the Cloakwood.\n",
[3877]="70072FC8\n1\tCollect Zajâni-made rune kits (total: 8)\tThe scholars of Zajâna seek to recover all remnants of their history taken by the invaders who oppressed them. They ask for assistance in making rune kits and sturdy keys to recover their lost knowledge. Create and deliver Zajâni-made Rune kits to Lejâl at Zajâna.\n2\tDeliver the Zajâni-made rune kits to Lejâl at Zajâna\tThe scholars of Zajâna seek to recover all remnants of their history taken by the invaders who oppressed them. They ask for assistance in making rune kits and sturdy keys to recover their lost knowledge. Create and deliver Zajâni-made rune kits to Lejâl at Zajâna.\n",
[3878]="70072F79\n1\tTBD\tViznak continues to assist the Kintai at Sul Madásh. He is looking for brave volunteers to assess his newest tinctures to combat the blight.\n",
[3879]="70072FDE\n1\tDefeat Utûgi at Uruthúsh in An Shêru (total: 20)\tThe forsaken land of An Shêru wakens, but the hold of evil upon the land remains. Assist the people of An Shêru and all of Mûr Ghala will benefit. Defeat Utûgi at Uruthúsh.\n",
[3880]="70072FCE\n1\tCollect Temámir dissolving tinctures (total: 8)\tTemámir dwarves prize the crystals and spice found across An Shêru. They ask for assistance in keeping up with demand for the items meant to separate salt and to uncover crystals for use in their subterranean home. Create and deliver Temámir dissolving tinctures.\n2\tDeliver eight Temámir dissolving tinctures to Semanísi at Jiret-menêsh\tTemámir dwarves prize the crystals and spice found across An Shêru. They ask for assistance in keeping up with demand for the items meant to separate salt and to uncover crystals for use in their subterranean home. Deliver dissolving tinctures to Semanísi.\n",
[3881]="70072FCA\n1\tCollect Kinta harvesting tools ([según el diario]/8)\tThe Kintai's duty to ensure Nisigím thrives is ceaseless. Though Sívigush threatens to corrupt the last vestiges of purity in the land, they shall endure. To assist them deliver Kinta harvesting tools to Sul Madásh. Craft Kinta harvesting tools for delivery to Aralath at Sul Madásh.\n2\tDeliver the Kinta harvesting tools to Aralath at Sul Madásh\tThe Kintai's duty to ensure Nisigím thrives is ceaseless. Though Sívigush threatens to corrupt the last vestiges of purity in the land, they shall endure. To assist them deliver Kinta harvesting tools to Sul Madásh. Deliver Kinta harvesting tools to Aralath at Sul Madásh.\n",
[3882]="70072FD3\n1\tDefeat bees in Medân Makhai (total: 12)\030Harvest honeycombs at Medân Makha (total: 8)\tKighân's recovery requires not only the sword, but also the plowshare. Assist the people by attending to more mundane efforts across the land. Harvest honeycombs at Medân Makhai.\n2\tDeliver the harvested honey to Lejâni at Zajâna\tKighân's recovery requires not only the sword, but also the plowshare. Assist the people by attending to more mundane efforts across the land. Deliver harvested honeycombs from Medân Makhai to Lejâl in Zajâna.\n",
[3883]="7006AA44\n1\tYou found some spider ichor\tYou have gathered spider ichor from the spiders in the area. Kavíra, the healer in Jadambor would have use of these.\n2\tCollect spider ichor south-east of Jadambor (total: 8)\tSpiders can be found near Jalkhûl to the south-east of Jadambor. Collect ichor and bring it to Kavíra in Jadambor.\n3\tBring the spider ichor to Kavíra in Jadambor\tBring the spider ichor to Kavíra in Jadambor in western Dil-irmíz.\n",
[3884]="70072F7B\n1\tCollect blight samples in the Mires of Moth Thúruch (total: 8)\tEnemies abound in Adagím. Bramble trolls in the Mires of Moth Thúruch spread the blight. The Kintai need assistance in destroying this enemy, the fungus they nurture, and identifying what malice they spread. Collect blight samples from Moth Thúruch.\n",
[3885]="70072FCF\n1\tKighân's recovery requires not only the sword, but also the plowshare. Assist the people by attending to more mundane efforts across the land. Find and pet cats around Zajâna.\t\n2\tKighân's recovery requires not only the sword, but also the plowshare. Assist the people by attending to more mundane efforts across the land. Find and pet cats around Zajâna.\t\n",
[3886]="70072FDB\n1\tFree caracals from cages at Jag Golód (total: 4)\030Free servals from cages at Jag Golód (total: 4)\tKighân stirs to recovery. They seek whatever aid they can find to aid their freedom, reclamation, and continued growth. Aid the people to receive adoration and favour throughout Mûr Ghala. Free caracals and servals from the cages Jag Golód in Kighân.\n",
[3887]="70072FC6\n1\tFree captured Beltáni (total: 6)\030Defeat Ordâkhai at Wither-watch (total: 12)\tHorrors across Idagâl, be they of the mind and stirred spirits or, the physical pain wrought by man, should be addressed for the betterment of Mûr Ghala. Free captives and defeat Ordâkhai at Wither-watch.\n",
[3888]="70072FC9\n1\tCollect ancient treasures (total: 10)\tIt is not only Men who stole treasures, lives, and lore from the people of Idâgal. Eaters of the dead, the sky-tamers, and the vile gredbyg, all contribute to the land's ills. You should collect ancient treasures at the Tombs of Khâb Ishil.\n2\tDeliver the treasures to Malêrti\tIt is not only Men who stole treasures, lives, and lore from the people of Idâgal. Eaters of the dead, the sky-tamers, and the vile gredbyg, all contribute to the land's ills. You should return to Malêrti at the Dawn-warden.\n",
[3889]="70072FDD\n1\tCollect a bucket of water from the watering hole near Sormedân (total: 5)\030Harvest grass from outside of Sormedân (total: 5)\tKighân's recovery requires not only the sword, but also the plowshare. Assist the people by attending to more mundane efforts across the land. Collect water and feed for cattle near Sormedân.\n2\tProvide fresh water to cattle in Sormedân (total: 5)\030Provide fresh grass to cattle in Sormedân (total: 5)\tKighân's recovery requires not only the sword, but also the plowshare. Assist the people by attending to more mundane efforts across the land. Feed and water the cattle near Sormedân.\n",
[3890]="70072FD4\n1\tDefeat the restless trees near Shádhag (total: 12)\030Burn the afflicted saplings near Shadâg (total: 10)\tKighân is beset by blight to the east. Help to stave off the infestation by burning the blight where it encroaches. Cull infected trees and burn the afflicted saplings near Shadâg.\n",
[3891]="70072FC0\n1\tDefeat drakes in Ushumût (total: 12)\030Destroy wild-drake eggs (total: 10)\tIt is not only Men who stole treasures, lives, and lore from the people of Idâgal. Eaters of the dead, the sky-tamers, and the vile gredbyg, all contribute to the land's ills. You should defeat drakes and destroy wild-drake eggs at Ushumût.\n",
[3892]="7006AAC8\n1\tDefeat the bog-lurker Hâzlur\tDefeat the powerful bog-lurker known as Hâzlur wandering Dil-irmíz.\n2\tReturn to Bôgalekh to inform them of Hâzlur's defeat\tReturn to Bôgalekh in Jadambor in Dil-irmíz to inform them of Hâzlur's defeat.\n",
[3893]="7006AAAC\n1\tDefeat the shade Râmakhir\tDefeat the powerful shade known as Râmakhir to the west of Jadambor.\n2\tReturn to Bôgalekh to inform them of Râmakhir's defeat\tReturn to Bôgalekh in Jadambor in the flooded undercity to inform them of Râmakhir's defeat.\n",
[3894]="7006AA93\n1\tYou found shade essence.\tYou have gathered shade essence from the shades in the area. Kavíra, the healer in Jadambor would have use of these.\n2\tCollect shade essence in Dil-irmíz (total: 10)\tShades can be found to the west of Jadambor. Collect their essence and bring it to Kavíra in Jadambor.\n3\tBring the shade essence to Kavíra in Jadambor\tBring the shade essence to Kavíra in Jadambor in western Dil-irmíz.\n",
[3895]="70072FC5\n1\tCollect a hay bale near Ahâba\tNot all are Idagâl is suffering. Some trials are more mundane, and the needs of the people require a gentle hand. Whatever aid you can, assists the future of Mûr Ghala. Return Nahíd's willful sheep to their pen.\n2\tWhistle at lost sheep (total: 5)\tNot all in Idagâl are suffering. Some trials are more mundane, and the needs of the people require a gentle hand. Whatever aid you can, assists the future of Mûr Ghala. You should find and whistle at the lost sheep to send them home.\n3\tTalk to Nahíd in Ahâba\tNot all in Idagâl are suffering. Some trials are more mundane, and the needs of the people require a gentle hand. Whatever aid you can, assists the future of Mûr Ghala. You should return to Nahíd.\n",
[3896]="70072FC7\n1\tCollect Ahâba dates (total: 8)\030Collect oasis mulberries (total: 10)\030Collect citrus fruits (total: 8)\tNot all in Idagâl are suffering. Some trials are more mundane, and the needs of the people require a gentle hand. Whatever aid you can, assists the future of Mûr Ghala. Collect fruit from around Ahâba.\n2\tTalk to Batâla\tNot all in Idagâl are suffering. Some trials are more mundane, and the needs of the people require a gentle hand. Whatever aid you can, assists the future of Mûr Ghala. You should return the fruit to Batâla.\n",
[3897]="7006AA94\n1\tYou found a pristine bog-lurker carapace.\tYou have gathered pristine carapaces from the bog-lurkers in the area. Kavíra, the healer in Jadambor would have use of these.\n2\tCollect pristine bog-lurker carapaces in Dil-irmíz (total: 8)\tBog-lurkers can be found in the area. Collect pristine carapaces from them and bring it to Kavíra in Jadambor.\n3\tBring the pristine bog-lurker carapaces to Kavíra in Jadambor\tBring the pristine bog-lurker carapaces to Kavíra in Jadambor in western Dil-irmíz.\n",
[3898]="70072FCD\n1\tPlace Kâparai wards (total: 5)\tHorrors across Idagâl, be they of the mind and stirred spirits or, the physical pain wrought by man, should be addressed for the betterment of Mûr Ghala. Place Kâparai wards.\n2\tHeal frightened Aradûni (total: 6)\tHorrors across Idagâl, be they of the mind and stirred spirits or, the physical pain wrought by man, should be addressed for the betterment of Mûr Ghala. Heal the frightened Aradûni.\n",
[3899]="70072FD2\n1\tExamine the mine at Erakúndo\030Examine the mine at Gebarakór\030Examine the mine at the Arch of Adazâr\030Examine the mine at Lâkindar\tThough the mines have been inspected, the dwarves of Jiret-menêsh still wish to ensure that no ill-activity has returned to the places where they may yet go. Return to the four mines and inspect them.\n",
[3900]="70072FCC\n1\tCollect Temámir salt grinders (total: 8)\tTemámir dwarves prize the crystals and spice found across An Shêru. They ask for assistance in keeping up with demand for the items meant to separate salt and to uncover crystals for use in their subterranean home. Create salt grinders for the Temámir at Jiret-menêsh.\n2\tDeliver eight Temámir salt grinders to Semanísi at Jiret-menêsh\tTemámir dwarves prize the crystals and spice found across An Shêru. They ask for assistance in keeping up with demand for the items meant to separate salt and to uncover crystals for use in their subterranean home. Deliver salt grinders to Semanísi in Jiret-menêsh.\n",
[3901]="70072FD5\n1\tEnter the Crypts of Gadim-ûn\tThe forsaken land of An Shêru wakens, but the hold of evil upon the land remains. Assist the people of An Shêru and all of Mûr Ghala will benefit. Silence the whispers in the crypts.\n2\tFind the whisper crypt to the east\tThe forsaken land of An Shêru wakens, but the hold of evil upon the land remains. Assist the people of An Shêru and all of Mûr Ghala will benefit. Silence the whispers in the crypts.\n3\tSing a song of Light to counter the Darkness\tThe forsaken land of An Shêru wakens, but the hold of evil upon the land remains. Assist the people of An Shêru and all of Mûr Ghala will benefit. Silence the whispers in the crypts.\n4\tFind the whispering crypt further to the east\tThe forsaken land of An Shêru wakens, but the hold of evil upon the land remains. Assist the people of An Shêru and all of Mûr Ghala will benefit. Silence the whispers in the crypts.\n5\tSing a song of Light to again counter the Darkness\tThe forsaken land of An Shêru wakens, but the hold of evil upon the land remains. Assist the people of An Shêru and all of Mûr Ghala will benefit. Silence the whispers in the crypts.\n6\tFind the whispering crypt to the south\tThe forsaken land of An Shêru wakens, but the hold of evil upon the land remains. Assist the people of An Shêru and all of Mûr Ghala will benefit. Silence the whispers in the crypts.\n7\tSing a song of Light to counter the Darkness\tThe forsaken land of An Shêru wakens, but the hold of evil upon the land remains. Assist the people of An Shêru and all of Mûr Ghala will benefit. Silence the whispers in the crypts.\n8\tFind the whispering crypt to the west\tThe forsaken land of An Shêru wakens, but the hold of evil upon the land remains. Assist the people of An Shêru and all of Mûr Ghala will benefit. Silence the whispers in the crypts.\n9\tSing a song of Light to counter the Darkness\tThe forsaken land of An Shêru wakens, but the hold of evil upon the land remains. Assist the people of An Shêru and all of Mûr Ghala will benefit. Silence the whispers in the crypts.\n",
[3902]="70072FD6\n1\tDefeat sword-wielding Dead near Jag Gólod in Kighân (total: 6)\030Defeat bow-wielding Dead near Jag Golód in Kighân (total: 6)\030Defeat sorcerous Dead near Jag Golód in Kighân (total: 2)\tFell magic has long plagued the lands of Kighân. With the restoration at hand, the people desire to rid the fell things that disturb their dead. Help them pay respects and purge the Restless Dead. Defeat the Dead at Jag Golód.\n",
[3903]="70072FCB\n1\tCollect Kinta sickles from around Sul Madásh (total: 4)\030Collect Kinta hoes from around Sul Madásh (total: 4)\tThe Kintai's duty to ensure Nisigím thrives is ceaseless. Though Sívigush threatens to corrupt the last vestiges of purity in the land, they shall endure. If you wish to assist them aid them in keeping Sul Madásh's farms orderly. Clean up the area near the farms of Sul Madásh.\n",
